# Stack: TypeScript

[% if kind == 'web' %]
TypeScript, React 19, React Router 8 (data mode); Vite builds `dist/` (never edited; dev server: `npm run dev`), nginx serves it. Node >= [[ node_version ]] runs tooling and `scripts/` (type stripping: no `enum` or `namespace`).
[% else %]
TypeScript on Node.js >= [[ node_version ]] with npm. Node runs the `.ts` sources directly (type stripping: no `enum` or `namespace`); `tsc` builds `dist/`, never edited.
[% endif %]
Done = code + tests + wiki.

- **Design records:** `docs/design/NNNN-*.md` from `0000-template.md`, a line in its `README.md` index (read only what it names). New feature, dependency or public interface (config keys, CLI, HTTP API, file formats): write one first.
- Never re-propose `TODO.md`'s "Decided against".

## Don't read

`package-lock.json` (use `npm ls --depth 0`), `CHANGELOG.md` (use `git log`), `node_modules/`, `dist/`, `coverage/`; generated wiki blocks (`<!-- generated:start/end -->`).

