| Install / add | `npm ci` / `npm install <pkg>` (dev: `-D`) |
| Lint, format | `npm run lint -- --fix`, `npm run format` |
| Types (strict) | `npm run typecheck` |
| Tests (80% floor) / integration | `npm test` / `npm run test:integration` |
| Wiki sections | `node scripts/gen-wiki.ts` |
